{"id": 1, "title": "Day 1", "topic": "First verbs & nouns", "date": "2026-11-21", "words": [{"id": "d1w1", "kind": "verb", "ru": "чита́ть / прочита́ть", "en": "to read", "pr": "chi-TAT' / pra-chi-TAT'", "pic": "open_book.png", "audio": "de483208fb.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "чита́ть (now)", "прочита́ть (future)"], "rows": [["я", "чита́ю", "прочита́ю"], ["ты", "чита́ешь", "прочита́ешь"], ["он / она́", "чита́ет", "прочита́ет"], ["мы", "чита́ем", "прочита́ем"], ["вы", "чита́ете", "прочита́ете"], ["они́", "чита́ют", "прочита́ют"], ["past: он", "чита́л", "прочита́л"], ["past: она́", "чита́ла", "прочита́ла"], ["past: они́", "чита́ли", "прочита́ли"], ["command", "чита́й(те)", "прочита́й(те)"]]}, "lemmas": ["чита́ть", "прочита́ть"]}, {"id": "d1w2", "kind": "verb", "ru": "писа́ть / написа́ть", "en": "to write", "pr": "pi-SAT' / na-pi-SAT'", "pic": "writing_hand.png", "audio": "ac2bca1e53.mp3", "note": "с changes to ш in every present form: писа́ть → пишу́.", "table": {"cols": ["", "писа́ть (now)", "написа́ть (future)"], "rows": [["я", "пишу́", "напишу́"], ["ты", "пи́шешь", "напи́шешь"], ["он / она́", "пи́шет", "напи́шет"], ["мы", "пи́шем", "напи́шем"], ["вы", "пи́шете", "напи́шете"], ["они́", "пи́шут", "напи́шут"], ["past: он", "писа́л", "написа́л"], ["past: она́", "писа́ла", "написа́ла"], ["past: они́", "писа́ли", "написа́ли"], ["command", "пиши́(те)", "напиши́(те)"]]}, "lemmas": ["писа́ть", "написа́ть"]}, {"id": "d1w3", "kind": "verb", "ru": "де́лать / сде́лать", "en": "to do, to make", "pr": "DYE-lat' / ZDYE-lat'", "pic": "hammer_and_wrench.png", "audio": "8ac8b332cf.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "де́лать (now)", "сде́лать (future)"], "rows": [["я", "де́лаю", "сде́лаю"], ["ты", "де́лаешь", "сде́лаешь"], ["он / она́", "де́лает", "сде́лает"], ["мы", "де́лаем", "сде́лаем"], ["вы", "де́лаете", "сде́лаете"], ["они́", "де́лают", "сде́лают"], ["past: он", "де́лал", "сде́лал"], ["past: она́", "де́лала", "сде́лала"], ["past: они́", "де́лали", "сде́лали"], ["command", "де́лай(те)", "сде́лай(те)"]]}, "lemmas": ["де́лать", "сде́лать"]}, {"id": "d1w4", "kind": "verb", "ru": "смотре́ть / посмотре́ть", "en": "to watch, to look", "pr": "smat-RYET' / pas-mat-RYET'", "pic": "eyes.png", "audio": "21482d7ab1.mp3", "note": "Same pattern as говори́ть: -ю, -ишь, -ит, -им, -ите, -ят.", "table": {"cols": ["", "смотре́ть (now)", "посмотре́ть (future)"], "rows": [["я", "смотрю́", "посмотрю́"], ["ты", "смо́тришь", "посмо́тришь"], ["он / она́", "смо́трит", "посмо́трит"], ["мы", "смо́трим", "посмо́трим"], ["вы", "смо́трите", "посмо́трите"], ["они́", "смо́трят", "посмо́трят"], ["past: он", "смотре́л", "посмотре́л"], ["past: она́", "смотре́ла", "посмотре́ла"], ["past: они́", "смотре́ли", "посмотре́ли"], ["command", "смотри́(те)", "посмотри́(те)"]]}, "lemmas": ["смотре́ть", "посмотре́ть"]}, {"id": "d1w5", "kind": "verb", "ru": "понима́ть / поня́ть", "en": "to understand", "pr": "pa-ni-MAT' / pa-NYAT'", "pic": "light_bulb.png", "audio": "92a3983353.mp3", "note": "поня́ть is irregular: its future is пойму́, поймёшь… (ё is always stressed).", "table": {"cols": ["", "понима́ть (now)", "поня́ть (future)"], "rows": [["я", "понима́ю", "пойму́"], ["ты", "понима́ешь", "поймёшь"], ["он / она́", "понима́ет", "поймёт"], ["мы", "понима́ем", "поймём"], ["вы", "понима́ете", "поймёте"], ["они́", "понима́ют", "пойму́т"], ["past: он", "понима́л", "по́нял"], ["past: она́", "понима́ла", "поняла́"], ["past: они́", "понима́ли", "по́няли"], ["command", "понима́й(те)", "пойми́(те)"]]}, "lemmas": ["понима́ть", "поня́ть"]}, {"id": "d1w6", "kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "кни́га", "en": "book", "pr": "KNI-ga", "pic": "closed_book.png", "audio": "25a00a5b01.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["case", "singular", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "кни́га", "кни́ги"], ["Genitive", "кни́ги", "книг"], ["Dative", "кни́ге", "кни́гам"], ["Accusative", "кни́гу", "кни́ги"], ["Instrumental", "кни́гой", "кни́гами"], ["Prepositional", "(о) кни́ге", "(о) кни́гах"]]}, "lemmas": ["кни́га"]}, {"id": "d1w7", "kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "дом", "en": "house, home", "pr": "dom", "pic": "house.png", "audio": "20432f9031.mp3", "note": "до́ма on its own also means “at home”. The plural ends in -а́, not -ы.", "table": {"cols": ["case", "singular", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "дом", "дома́"], ["Genitive", "до́ма", "домо́в"], ["Dative", "до́му", "дома́м"], ["Accusative", "дом", "дома́"], ["Instrumental", "до́мом", "дома́ми"], ["Prepositional", "(о) до́ме", "(о) дома́х"]]}, "lemmas": ["дом"]}, {"id": "d1w8", "kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "вода́", "en": "water", "pr": "va-DA", "pic": "droplet.png", "audio": "a2282d5e89.mp3", "note": "The stress jumps: вода́ but во́ду.", "table": {"cols": ["case", "singular", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "вода́", "во́ды"], ["Genitive", "воды́", "вод"], ["Dative", "воде́", "во́дам"], ["Accusative", "во́ду", "во́ды"], ["Instrumental", "водо́й", "во́дами"], ["Prepositional", "(о) воде́", "(о) во́дах"]]}, "lemmas": ["вода́"]}, {"id": "d1w9", "kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "друг", "en": "friend", "pr": "druk", "pic": "people_hugging.png", "audio": "9e5e9b59a8.mp3", "note": "Irregular plural: друзья́. For people, accusative = genitive (дру́га, друзе́й).", "table": {"cols": ["case", "singular", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "друг", "друзья́"], ["Genitive", "дру́га", "друзе́й"], ["Dative", "дру́гу", "друзья́м"], ["Accusative", "дру́га", "друзе́й"], ["Instrumental", "дру́гом", "друзья́ми"], ["Prepositional", "(о) дру́ге", "(о) друзья́х"]]}, "lemmas": ["друг"]}, {"id": "d1w10", "kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "го́род", "en": "city, town", "pr": "GO-rat", "pic": "cityscape.png", "audio": "9512c2ee52.mp3", "note": "Like дом, the plural ends in -а́: города́.", "table": {"cols": ["case", "singular", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "го́род", "города́"], ["Genitive", "го́рода", "городо́в"], ["Dative", "го́роду", "города́м"], ["Accusative", "го́род", "города́"], ["Instrumental", "го́родом", "города́ми"], ["Prepositional", "(о) го́роде", "(о) города́х"]]}, "lemmas": ["го́род"]}], "sentences": [{"id": "d1s1", "word": "d1w1", "ru": "Я чита́ю кни́гу.", "en": "I am reading a book.", "pr": "ya chi-TA-yu KNI-gu", "pics": ["person.png", "open_book.png"], "audio": "48526fd171.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s2", "word": "d1w1", "ru": "Я прочита́л кни́гу.", "en": "I read the book (all of it).", "pr": "ya pra-chi-TAL KNI-gu", "pics": ["open_book.png", "check_mark_button.png"], "audio": "2f2393d66d.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s3", "word": "d1w1", "ru": "Он чита́ет газе́ту.", "en": "He is reading a newspaper.", "pr": "on chi-TA-yet ga-ZYE-tu", "pics": ["man.png", "newspaper.png"], "audio": "62ac46374c.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s4", "word": "d1w1", "ru": "Что ты чита́ешь?", "en": "What are you reading?", "pr": "shto tih chi-TA-yesh'", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "books.png"], "audio": "78e4af7e43.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s5", "word": "d1w2", "ru": "Она́ пи́шет письмо́.", "en": "She is writing a letter.", "pr": "a-NA PI-shet pis'-MO", "pics": ["woman.png", "writing_hand.png", "envelope.png"], "audio": "d5c0c9a2f3.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s6", "word": "d1w2", "ru": "Она́ написа́ла письмо́.", "en": "She wrote the letter (it's done).", "pr": "a-NA na-pi-SA-la pis'-MO", "pics": ["envelope.png", "check_mark_button.png"], "audio": "3c19bb086f.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s7", "word": "d1w2", "ru": "Я пишу́ по-ру́сски.", "en": "I write in Russian.", "pr": "ya pi-SHU pa-RUS-ki", "pics": ["pencil.png", "notebook.png"], "audio": "76a8111295.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s8", "word": "d1w2", "ru": "Напиши́ мне!", "en": "Write to me!", "pr": "na-pi-SHI mnye", "pics": ["mobile_phone.png", "speech_balloon.png"], "audio": "09c8005a93.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s9", "word": "d1w3", "ru": "Что ты де́лаешь?", "en": "What are you doing?", "pr": "shto tih DYE-la-yesh'", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "hammer_and_wrench.png"], "audio": "f5f9b9277c.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s10", "word": "d1w3", "ru": "Я сде́лал дома́шнее зада́ние.", "en": "I did my homework.", "pr": "ya ZDYE-lal da-MASH-ni-ye za-DA-ni-ye", "pics": ["notebook.png", "check_mark_button.png"], "audio": "fe0751fbd2.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s11", "word": "d1w3", "ru": "Мы де́лаем пи́ццу.", "en": "We are making pizza.", "pr": "mih DYE-la-yem PI-tsu", "pics": ["cook.png", "pizza.png"], "audio": "c746ae8bf4.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s12", "word": "d1w3", "ru": "Сде́лай э́то сего́дня.", "en": "Do it today.", "pr": "ZDYE-lai E-ta si-VOD-nya", "pics": ["tear-off_calendar.png", "alarm_clock.png"], "audio": "75716935b0.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s13", "word": "d1w4", "ru": "Мы смо́трим фильм.", "en": "We are watching a film.", "pr": "mih SMOT-rim fil'm", "pics": ["television.png", "popcorn.png"], "audio": "061ef0b138.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s14", "word": "d1w4", "ru": "Посмотри́ сюда́!", "en": "Look here!", "pr": "pas-mat-RI syu-DA", "pics": ["eyes.png", "backhand_index_pointing_down.png"], "audio": "ef5a51d9f8.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s15", "word": "d1w4", "ru": "Я посмотре́л фильм вчера́.", "en": "I watched the film yesterday.", "pr": "ya pas-mat-RYEL fil'm fchi-RA", "pics": ["film_frames.png", "check_mark_button.png"], "audio": "816962154b.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s16", "word": "d1w4", "ru": "Ты смо́тришь футбо́л?", "en": "Do you watch football?", "pr": "tih SMOT-rish' fut-BOL", "pics": ["television.png", "soccer_ball.png"], "audio": "dcb2ea08bd.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s17", "word": "d1w5", "ru": "Я не понима́ю.", "en": "I don't understand.", "pr": "ya ni pa-ni-MA-yu", "pics": ["confused_face.png", "red_question_mark.png"], "audio": "2e311bf5e3.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s18", "word": "d1w5", "ru": "Тепе́рь я по́нял!", "en": "Now I get it!", "pr": "ti-PYER' ya PO-nyal", "pics": ["grinning_face.png", "light_bulb.png"], "audio": "d4baa1857b.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s19", "word": "d1w5", "ru": "Вы понима́ете по-ру́сски?", "en": "Do you understand Russian?", "pr": "vih pa-ni-MA-ye-tye pa-RUS-ki", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "speech_balloon.png"], "audio": "a327ae5d0d.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s20", "word": "d1w5", "ru": "Я тебя́ понима́ю.", "en": "I understand you.", "pr": "ya ti-BYA pa-ni-MA-yu", "pics": ["smiling_face_with_smiling_eyes.png", "left_speech_bubble.png"], "audio": "5a093ccadb.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s21", "word": "d1w6", "ru": "Э́то моя́ кни́га.", "en": "This is my book.", "pr": "E-ta ma-YA KNI-ga", "pics": ["smiling_face.png", "closed_book.png"], "audio": "88049915f8.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s22", "word": "d1w6", "ru": "У меня́ нет кни́ги.", "en": "I don't have a book.", "pr": "u mi-NYA nyet KNI-gi", "pics": ["closed_book.png", "cross_mark.png"], "audio": "b1362b6e52.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s23", "word": "d1w6", "ru": "Я ду́маю о кни́ге.", "en": "I'm thinking about the book.", "pr": "ya DU-ma-yu a KNI-gye", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "closed_book.png"], "audio": "ae18f28d71.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s24", "word": "d1w6", "ru": "Где моя́ кни́га?", "en": "Where is my book?", "pr": "gdye ma-YA KNI-ga", "pics": ["magnifying_glass_tilted_left.png", "closed_book.png"], "audio": "d63d620b53.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s25", "word": "d1w7", "ru": "Я до́ма.", "en": "I'm at home.", "pr": "ya DO-ma", "pics": ["smiling_face_with_smiling_eyes.png", "house.png"], "audio": "ecc3fb4a78.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s26", "word": "d1w7", "ru": "Мы живём в большо́м до́ме.", "en": "We live in a big house.", "pr": "mih zhi-VYOM v bal'-SHOM DO-mye", "pics": ["house_with_garden.png"], "audio": "3812e575ef.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s27", "word": "d1w7", "ru": "Я иду́ домо́й.", "en": "I'm going home.", "pr": "ya i-DU da-MOI", "pics": ["person_walking.png", "house.png"], "audio": "d61258f32f.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s28", "word": "d1w7", "ru": "Э́то наш дом.", "en": "This is our house.", "pr": "E-ta nash dom", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "house_with_garden.png"], "audio": "4896afc26a.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s29", "word": "d1w8", "ru": "Я пью во́ду.", "en": "I drink water.", "pr": "ya pyu VO-du", "pics": ["cup_with_straw.png", "droplet.png"], "audio": "06d0219c79.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s30", "word": "d1w8", "ru": "Стака́н воды́, пожа́луйста.", "en": "A glass of water, please.", "pr": "sta-KAN va-DIH pa-ZHA-lus-ta", "pics": ["tumbler_glass.png", "droplet.png"], "audio": "b33df534a5.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s31", "word": "d1w8", "ru": "Вода́ холо́дная.", "en": "The water is cold.", "pr": "va-DA kha-LOD-na-ya", "pics": ["droplet.png", "cold_face.png"], "audio": "189a30a100.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s32", "word": "d1w8", "ru": "Без воды́ нет жи́зни.", "en": "Without water there is no life.", "pr": "byez va-DIH nyet ZHIZ-ni", "pics": ["droplet.png", "seedling.png"], "audio": "c5f760edce.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s33", "word": "d1w9", "ru": "Э́то мой друг.", "en": "This is my friend.", "pr": "E-ta moi druk", "pics": ["people_hugging.png"], "audio": "47273a9fad.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s34", "word": "d1w9", "ru": "Я звоню́ дру́гу.", "en": "I'm calling a friend.", "pr": "ya zva-NYU DRU-gu", "pics": ["mobile_phone.png", "telephone_receiver.png"], "audio": "2b46e9504a.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s35", "word": "d1w9", "ru": "У меня́ мно́го друзе́й.", "en": "I have a lot of friends.", "pr": "u mi-NYA MNO-ga dru-ZYEI", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "party_popper.png"], "audio": "ad0a1736d5.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s36", "word": "d1w9", "ru": "Мы с дру́гом игра́ем в волейбо́л.", "en": "My friend and I play volleyball.", "pr": "mih s DRU-gam ig-RA-yem v va-lei-BOL", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "volleyball.png"], "audio": "8fba2c9905.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s37", "word": "d1w10", "ru": "Ри́га — краси́вый го́род.", "en": "Riga is a beautiful city.", "pr": "RI-ga kra-SI-vih GO-rat", "pics": ["cityscape.png", "sparkles.png"], "audio": "25c8ab8232.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s38", "word": "d1w10", "ru": "Я живу́ в го́роде.", "en": "I live in a city.", "pr": "ya zhi-VU v GO-ra-dye", "pics": ["cityscape.png", "house.png"], "audio": "9bab213708.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s39", "word": "d1w10", "ru": "Э́то большо́й го́род.", "en": "This is a big city.", "pr": "E-ta bal'-SHOI GO-rat", "pics": ["cityscape_at_dusk.png", "office_building.png"], "audio": "6422ab92ea.mp3"}, {"id": "d1s40", "word": "d1w10", "ru": "Мы е́дем в друго́й го́род.", "en": "We are going to another city.", "pr": "mih YE-dim v dru-GOI GO-rat", "pics": ["bus.png", "cityscape.png"], "audio": "baf2d8b860.mp3"}], "notes": [{"h": "Verb pairs", "lines": ["Imperfective = the process, ongoing or repeated (I am reading). It has a present tense.", "Perfective = one finished action with a result (I read it to the end). Its present-looking forms mean the FUTURE.", "Imperfective future: бу́ду + infinitive (я бу́ду чита́ть = I will be reading).", "Past tense changes only by gender/number: он -л, она́ -ла, оно́ -ло, они́ -ли."]}, {"h": "How the present is built", "lines": ["Take off -ть to get the stem: чита́ть → чита-.", "Pattern 1: я -ю, ты -ешь, он -ет, мы -ем, вы -ете, они́ -ют (чита́ть, де́лать, понима́ть).", "Pattern 2: я -ю, ты -ишь, он -ит, мы -им, вы -ите, они́ -ят (говори́ть, смотре́ть).", "The ты form tells you the pattern: -ешь → 1, -ишь → 2."]}], "video": "videos/day1.mp4"}